  "body": "podliner v2.5.0\n\na theme that follows your terminal's colours (#41).\n\n## new\n\n- **`:theme terminal`.** draws with your terminal's black and white only (color0 and color7) and shows the selection by swapping them. palettes generated from the wallpaper, like matugen's, can make bright black light, which left the details pane and the log window close to unreadable. with this theme podliner follows the palette when it changes. the default theme is unchanged. thanks to notRyuk for the report.\n"
